statement: >
  S3-native storage kernel in Rust: the single atomic point through which
  durable state is written. Extracted from the yeetz forge (parent:
  cleverunicornz/yeetz) because it is infrastructure consumed by multiple
  products; this repo is the kernel's source of record.
